{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Then Moses sang.</b> Moses said before the Holy One, blessed be He: Master of the universe — with 'az' I called out before You, as it is written: ״מאז באתי אל פרעה״ etc., and with 'az' I praise before You. Another explanation: 'az' in gematria is eight, to say: in the merit of circumcision, which was given on the eighth day, He split the sea for us, as it is written: ״לגוזר ים סוף לגזרים״ — and וימל is translated [in the Targum] as וגזר."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:11.719481220Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}